{"@context":"https://schema.org","@type":"Article","@id":"https://tianbuyu-wwx.github.io/Tang-Poetry/poem.html?id=open_42440","headline":"鼎臣学士侍郎楚金舍人学士以再伤庭梅诗同垂宠和清绝感叹情致俱深因成四十字陈谢 · 汤悦","name":"鼎臣学士侍郎楚金舍人学士以再伤庭梅诗同垂宠和清绝感叹情致俱深因成四十字陈谢","inLanguage":"zh-Hans","text":"人物同迁谢，重成念旧悲。\n连华得琼玖，合奏发埙篪。\n余枿虽无取，残芳尚获知。\n问君何所似，珍重杜[秋]诗。","author":{"@type":"Person","name":"汤悦","nationality":"唐"},"publisher":{"@type":"Organization","name":"石湖诗社","url":"https://tianbuyu-wwx.github.io/Tang-Poetry/"},"image":"https://tianbuyu-wwx.github.io/Tang-Poetry/og/open_42440.png","mainEntityOfPage":"https://tianbuyu-wwx.github.io/Tang-Poetry/poem.html?id=open_42440","isPartOf":{"@type":"WebSite","name":"石湖诗社","url":"https://tianbuyu-wwx.github.io/Tang-Poetry/"},"genre":"杂言古诗","abstract":"收录于https://github.com/chinese-poetry/chinese-poetry"}